 	//
 	// expect_after_value is what to expect after seeing a value (a literal,
 	// number, string, array or object). For depth 0, this is ignored.
 	// Otherwise, it should be (EXPECT_CLOSE_FOO | EXPECT_COMMA), for some
 	// value of FOO.
